> Although I personally do not use a Mac, I liked the way he organized the topics (limited topics but well organized). Also, at some point, this being a web driven project, we may need to give some thoughts of incorporating links to other sites and incorporating a search algorithm (searching both internal documents, CRAN, as well the WWW).
