That was already suggested. It is something we will propose with the 
"expert/advanced -or whatever we will call it" pictogram. In the one I 
propose, it is not a curve in the road, but a red panel with a 
radioactive sign, 'cause I find it even more expressive.

Note that there is also the counterpart: a blue sign with a question 
mark indicates a part for novices, thus trivial for all the others.

... But these skill indicators are still in discussion: some do not like 
them, and for the others, we are still looking for a good name for the 
three skill levels (novice versus "standard" user versus advanced) and 
also how to define them clearly.

Best,

